    <briefdescription>
<para>A class for generating fractal noise functions based on an underlying noise function. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The <computeroutput><ref refid="classhmap_1_1GenericFractalFunction" kindref="compound">GenericFractalFunction</ref></computeroutput> class generates fractal noise using an underlying base noise function. It allows customization of the fractal properties such as octaves, weight, persistence, and lacunarity. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
